 { For now White controls the open d-file, but Black is ready to play 1...Rad8. Can you find the only move that leads to an advantage for White? } 1. { -KEY- } Nd7 $1 Bxd7 2. Rxd7 $16 { Correct! White uses their tempo to not only rob Black of the bishop pair, but to plant a rook on the powerful seventh rank. White went on to win in the online game Carlsen,M - Alekseenko,K (2023). } 
