 { Black appears to be in trouble with his knight under attack. However, he has one saving move. Can you find it? } 1... { -KEY- } f6 $1 { The counter-attack on White's strong knight allows Black to survive by the skin of his teeth. } ( 1... Na6 $4 2. Rd7 { Allowing the rook to hit the seventh rank would be lights out. White could pick up either the a7 or f7 pawn next. } Ke8 3. Rxf7 $18 ) 
2. bxc5 fxe5 $11 { Correct! Black has avoided the invasion along the seventh rank and is left with a messy but equal rook and pawn endgame. } 
