 { A messy position, with White's bishop on a4 under attack and Black's f6 rook pinned. Find the strongest move for White. } 1. { -KEY- } Rh1 $1 ( 1. Bb3 $2 Bb7 $11 { White is now too slow to add pressure to the f6 rook. } ) 
