2. Rxh7 $1 { Correct! The mix of connected passed pawns in the centre and the invasion of both rooks leaves Black without any chance to save the game. Let's show one sample line. } Bxg5 3. Rh8+ Kf7 4. R1h7+ Kf6 5. Rf8+ Ke5 6. Re8+ Kf6 7. e5+ Kf5 8. exd6 $18 
